driver-intercom/intercom_proxy/

# --- Build output, generic ---
build/
dist/
*.bin
*.elf
*.map
*.o

# --- Secrets / local config ---
**/secrets.h
**/wifi_credentials.h
*.local
.env


# --- OS / editor ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/
**/.history/

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
